{"asset_key":"ep7/herohub_story_17411180","episode":"ep7","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"17411180","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1741118001:1":{"text":"후... 이 햇살과 산들바람! 이런 게 바로 삶이지!","source_cn":"呼……这阳光，这微风，这才叫生活嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB2C45976A1CB36B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1741118002:1":{"text":"고대의 전당과 함께 공주가 사라져 버리더니... 이젠 공기 중에서도 섬뜩한 공포의 냄새가 가득하네.","source_cn":"可惜又是圣古堂消失，又是公主不见的……连空气里都是恐慌...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB52CAB7A369631A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1741118003:1":{"text":"원래대로라면 사바나의 전설적인 여우로서, 이 몸도 이곳의 평화를 지키기 위해 뭔가를 해야 하긴 해.","source_cn":"原则上，身为赛凡纳的传奇狐狸，我也得为维护赛凡纳的安宁...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD00B18E78CF51493","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1741118004:1":{"text":"하지만 겨우 몸을 따끈따끈하게 데웠는데, 움직이고 싶지 않단 말이지...","source_cn":"可是好不容易才把身子晒得暖烘烘的，真不想动弹啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05A4B8F212BBBC51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:小狐狸":{"text":"작은 여우","source":"小狐狸","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}